From 972895301e89d4b6407b3e47998a842b3ba1a610 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Dubina <dmitryd.prog@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:15:30 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add block-out-blur window rule

Blocked-out windows can be blurred instead of filled with solid black: the
window is rendered as usual and a framebuffer blur is drawn on top of it.
The rule takes the same settings as the global blur section.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
